memory/PRD.md:
   6  ## Core Features (Implemented)
   7: - **Home**: Hero with video bg, rating badge (4.0★/136 Google Reviews), CTAs
   8  - **About**: Restaurant story with values grid

  12  - **Reviews**: Google Reviews auto-sync (backend API), review cards, "Leave a Review" redirect
  13: - **Google Review Prompt**: Smart rating (4-5★→Google, 1-3★→private feedback)
  14  - **Contact**: Form (WhatsApp), Google Maps embed + fallback, contact cards

