  31:   "context_for_next_testing_agent": "This is a frontend-only React app for Kurry Leaf restaurant. Key tested features: (1) Mobile hero - Instagram badge hidden on mobile via 'hidden md:flex', (2) Hamburger menu with all nav links + Instagram + phone + WhatsApp button, (3) Google Review Prompt with star rating - 4-5 stars shows Google redirect button, 1-3 stars shows private feedback form, feedback stored in localStorage 'kurryleaf_private_feedback', rate again resets flow. All sections mobile responsive at 375px and 320px.",
  32    "features_tested": {

